Thanks to @sundarpichai, Koray Kavukcuoglu is honored to lead Google DeepMind into the next chapter, focusing on Gemini models, frontier AI research, and building products for users and partners.

@Demishassabis becomes Chair of Google DeepMind and Chief Scientist of Alphabet, dedicating his focus to shaping the future of AGI and scientific discovery, while remaining connected to Koray and the GDM teams.

Koray has been at GDM for 13 years, starting the deep learning team and driving breakthroughs like WaveNet and DQN. The leadership changes mark an exciting new phase for GDM's AI momentum.
